  {
   "id": "cb_f0f0b6a610890dbebc29a904",
   "order": 13,
   "title_en": "FAQ",
   "body_en": "1.Accessory Compatibility\nCompatible with all printers, AMS, build plate, and nozzles.\n\n2.Drying Recommendations\nDry before use to ensure the best print quality and consistent finish. Store in a dry environment after use. For more details, please refer to: Filament drying instructions on WIKI.\n\n3.Refill Guidelines\nThe refill filament needs to be used with a spool. For detailed instructions on how to swap in the new filament using the Bambu Reusable Spool, please refer to the guide on WIKI.",
   "url": "",
   "source_media_id": "",
   "source_url": "",
   "alt_en": "",
   "alt_ar": "",
   "alt_ckb": "",
   "kind": "text",
   "section_kind": "faq",
   "section_path": "components[4]"
  },
  {
   "id": "cb_bdbeca4131962a9aa1c503f0",
   "order": 14,
   "title_en": "Highlights",
   "body_en": "• Easy to Print & Beginner Friendly\n• Smooth Surface Finish\n• Biodegradable\n• PLA Basic - Bambu Green (Filament with Spool / 1KG) *1\n• PLA Basic - Jade White (Filament with Spool / 1 KG) *1\n• PLA Basic - Gray (Filament with Spool / 1 KG ) *1\n• PLA Basic - Black (Filament with Spool / 1 KG) *1\n• What's in the Bundle",
   "url": "",
